'''Carrot''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was obtainable by collecting 600 [[Eggs (Currency)|Eggs]] {{Currency|Egg}} during the [[Easter Event 2023|2023 Easter Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is orange, with the guard being vines. The handle is solid black. The design is similar to a carrot, hence the name.

==Trivia==
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

